msgid ""
"VR headset (**Pico Enterprise** recommended; Pico consumer or **Meta "
"Quest** also used)"
msgstr "VR 头显（**推荐 Pico 企业版**；也可用 Pico 消费版或 **Meta Quest**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:34
#: 59018e11bd4542c288062f51439f805f
msgid "fa-py-libraries installed"
msgstr "已安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:35
#: 013afe2d0dc94018a87cfaeaba4f5d69
msgid ""
"Network between the headset and the ROS 2 machine (Wi-Fi, or **USB 网络共享**"
" on Pico Enterprise)"
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机之间的网络（Wi-Fi，或 Pico 企业版上的 **USB 网络共享**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:36
#: 1274b2e384184c5bac20f98d84a09bd1
msgid ""
"**`enable_vr: true`** in the robot description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off)"
msgstr ""
"在机器人描述的 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中设置 **`enable_vr: "
"true`**（多数机型默认关闭）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:38
#: 16c88311868f49dcb721518ba8113ee8
msgid ""
"Before the controller will consume VR targets, set `enable_vr: true` in "
"that YAML. Related fields on the same file: `vr_update_rate` (used when "
"VR is on) and `vr_follow_frame` (full-body follow frame; see "
"[Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting))."
msgstr ""
"控制器要消费 VR 目标之前，先在该 YAML 里把 `enable_vr: true` "
"打开。同一文件里相关字段：`vr_update_rate`（启用 VR 后生效）和 `vr_follow_frame`（全身跟随坐标系；见 "
"[故障排除](#troubleshooting)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:40
#: 30d0f14de66c4c2a90e99db86669bdab
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:42
#: f64f2dc214d548efb23bfde21a7e60ac
msgid ""
"VR teleoperation publishes end-effector pose targets from VR controller "
"tracking. The MPC controller then generates joint trajectories to follow "
"these targets."
msgstr "VR 遥操作根据 VR 手柄追踪发布末端执行器位姿目标。随后由 MPC 控制器生成关节轨迹以跟随这些目标。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:44
#: b15424c096e54addb67fe7bea6711b2f
msgid ""
"How the arm **complies** with those poses depends on the robot. Two "
"different paths are used with VR teleop:"
msgstr "手臂如何**柔顺**跟踪这些位姿取决于机型。VR 遥操作使用两条不同路径："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: b54f965b5ce046589cb5aaa54a2a5456
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 080b9300f8ed43a9898bb9553f1892d7
msgid "Robots"
msgstr "机器人"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: a1d6dd81f0a3475da8224b3b3711c07b
msgid "Who provides compliance"
msgstr "柔顺由谁提供"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: a378ad0e64ae4747aa57b6113f6f2ac1
