#: 2bdcec6b914c400dad5d50ebc5a54cb4
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) is supported — "
"tether the headset to the PC over USB so they share a network. Follow the"
" headset’s own USB-network UI; this page does not list ADB or `usb0` "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"**Pico 企业版：** 支持 USB 网络共享 — 用 USB 将头显连接到电脑以共享网络。按头显自带的 USB 网络界面操作；本页不列出 "
"ADB 或 `usb0` 命令。"

